## Rules Summary

1. ✅ **Always** use multi-key caching (3+ lookup patterns)
2. ✅ **Always** implement hash-based change detection before D1 writes
3. ✅ **Always** track cache metrics (hits/misses/writes)
4. ✅ **Always** use non-blocking metrics (catch errors)
5. ✅ **Always** set appropriate TTLs (1h dev, 24h prod)
6. ✅ **Always** index individual resources
7. ✅ **Always** protect ingest endpoints with secrets
8. ❌ **Never** write to D1 without checking cache first
9. ❌ **Never** use single-key caching
10. ❌ **Never** skip change detection for idempotent operations

